          <msContents>
            <summary>Headings in red. The recto of the first leaf, and the verso of the last contain pen-drawn kabbalistic diagrams in red, black and purple. In the centre of the first is the Almighty upon a throne with one foot upon the world: in the centre of the second the Lamb resting upon the Book with Seven Seals and illustrating the text 'Vidi Satanam sicut fulgur de coelo cadentem'. On the recto of the second leaf the names of the seven Spirits of the days of the week are written in different coloured inks.</summary>
